eam/apps/4090830/6624640a735b939f89ec07bc3396d11601f1e202/ss_6624640a735b939f89ec07bc3396d11601f1e202.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760105546","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090830/6624640a735b939f89ec07bc3396d11601f1e202/ss_6624640a735b939f89ec07bc3396d11601f1e202.600x338.jpg?t=1760105546"}],"short_description":"Photographer Charlotte Gray travels to Deer Creek to document a long deserted logging camp for her upcoming book \u201dForgotten Frontiers\u201d. She finds not only a derelict camp, but also a mournful tale of family, love and loyalty hidden beneath the Alaskan snow, in this point-and-click adventure.","steam_appid":4090830,"support_info":{"email":"contact@sparrowland.studio","url":"https://www.sparrowland.studio"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}